// ── Beck depression inventory answers (code suffix after the dash is the score) ──
* #bdi.1-0 "I do not feel sad."
* #bdi.1-1 "I feel sad."
* #bdi.1-2 "I am sad all the time and I can't snap out of it."
* #bdi.1-3 "I am so sad and unhappy that I can't stand it."
* #bdi.2-0 "I am not particularly discouraged about the future."
* #bdi.2-1 "I feel discouraged about the future."
* #bdi.2-2 "I feel I have nothing to look forward to."
* #bdi.2-3 "I feel the future is hopeless and that things cannot improve."
* #bdi.3-0 "I do not feel like a failure."
* #bdi.3-1 "I feel I have failed more than the average person."
* #bdi.3-2 "As I look back on my life, all I can see is a lot of failures."
* #bdi.3-3 "I feel I am a complete failure as a person."
* #bdi.4-0 "I get as much satisfaction out of things as I used to."
* #bdi.4-1 "I don't enjoy things the way I used to."
* #bdi.4-2 "I don't get real satisfaction out of anything anymore."
* #bdi.4-3 "I am dissatisfied or bored with everything."
* #bdi.5-0 "I don't feel particularly guilty."
* #bdi.5-1 "I feel guilty a good part of the time."
* #bdi.5-2 "I feel quite guilty most of the time."
* #bdi.5-3 "I feel guilty all of the time."
* #bdi.6-0 "I don't feel I am being punished."
* #bdi.6-1 "I feel I may be punished."
* #bdi.6-2 "I expect to be punished."
* #bdi.6-3 "I feel I am being punished."
* #bdi.7-0 "I don't feel disappointed in myself."
* #bdi.7-1 "I am disappointed in myself."
* #bdi.7-2 "I am disgusted with myself."
* #bdi.7-3 "I hate myself."
* #bdi.8-0 "I don't feel I am any worse than anybody else."
* #bdi.8-1 "I am critical of myself for my weaknesses or mistakes."
* #bdi.8-2 "I blame myself all the time for my faults."
* #bdi.8-3 "I blame myself for everything bad that happens."
* #bdi.9-0 "I don't have any thoughts of killing myself."
* #bdi.9-1 "I have thoughts of killing myself, but I would not carry them out."
* #bdi.9-2 "I would like to kill myself."
* #bdi.9-3 "I would kill myself if I had the chance."
* #bdi.10-0 "I don't cry any more than usual."
* #bdi.10-1 "I cry more now than I used to."
* #bdi.10-2 "I cry all the time now."
* #bdi.10-3 "I used to be able to cry, but now I can't cry even though I want to."
* #bdi.11-0 "I am no more irritated by things than I ever was."
* #bdi.11-1 "I am slightly more irritated now than usual."
* #bdi.11-2 "I am quite annoyed or irritated a good deal of the time."
* #bdi.11-3 "I feel irritated all the time."
* #bdi.12-0 "I have not lost interest in other people."
* #bdi.12-1 "I am less interested in other people than I used to be."
* #bdi.12-2 "I have lost most of my interest in other people."
* #bdi.12-3 "I have lost all of my interest in other people."
* #bdi.13-0 "I make decisions about as well as I ever could."
* #bdi.13-1 "I put off making decisions more than I used to."
* #bdi.13-2 "I have greater difficulty in making decisions than I used to."
* #bdi.13-3 "I can't make decisions at all anymore."
* #bdi.14-0 "I don't feel that I look any worse than I used to."
* #bdi.14-1 "I am worried that I am looking old or unattractive."
* #bdi.14-2 "I feel there are permanent changes in my appearance that make me look unattractive."
* #bdi.14-3 "I believe that I look ugly."
* #bdi.15-0 "I can work about as well as before."
* #bdi.15-1 "It takes an extra effort to get started at doing something."
* #bdi.15-2 "I have to push myself very hard to do anything."
* #bdi.15-3 "I can't do any work at all."
* #bdi.16-0 "I can sleep as well as usual."
* #bdi.16-1 "I don't sleep as well as I used to."
* #bdi.16-2 "I wake up 1-2 hours earlier than usual and find it hard to get back to sleep."
* #bdi.16-3 "I wake up several hours earlier than I used to and cannot get back to sleep."
* #bdi.17-0 "I don't get more tired than usual."
* #bdi.17-1 "I get tired more easily than I used to."
* #bdi.17-2 "I get tired from doing almost anything."
* #bdi.17-3 "I am too tired to do anything."
* #bdi.18-0 "My appetite is no worse than usual."
* #bdi.18-1 "My appetite is not as good as it used to be."
* #bdi.18-2 "My appetite is much worse now."
* #bdi.18-3 "I have no appetite at all anymore."
* #bdi.19-0 "I haven't lost much weight, if any, lately."
* #bdi.19-1 "I have lost more than five pounds."
* #bdi.19-2 "I have lost more than ten pounds."
* #bdi.19-3 "I have lost more than fifteen pounds."
* #bdi.20-0 "I am no more worried about my health than usual."
* #bdi.20-1 "I am worried about physical problems like aches, pains, upset stomach or constipation."
* #bdi.20-2 "I am very worried about physical problems and it's hard to think of much else."
* #bdi.20-3 "I am so worried about my physical problems that I cannot think of anything else."
* #bdi.21-0 "I have not noticed any recent change in my interest in sex."
* #bdi.21-1 "I am less interested in sex than I used to be."
* #bdi.21-2 "I have almost no interest in sex."
* #bdi.21-3 "I have lost interest in sex completely."

